.TH GRMODELS 1
.SH NAME
grmodels \- mesh viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/grmodels
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I GrModels
is a mesh viewer.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
View a UV-sphere or stick figure. Drag or use the arrows to rotate; b and m switch models; minus and plus zoom.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B b
UV-sphere mode
.TP
.B m
Stick-man mode
.TP
.B Enter
Regenerate mesh
.TP
.B - / _
Zoom out
.TP
.B arrows
Yaw/pitch
.TP
.B LMB drag
Rotate view
.TP
.B f
Toggle face fill
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/grmodels.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR wm (1)
